ReadAloudKit community scoring heads
====================================

Applies to everything under `releases/` — the ONNX graphs and the `scoring.json`
manifests beside them. The source in this repository is Apache-2.0 and is
covered by `LICENSE` instead; the third-party acoustic checkpoint is covered by
neither, see `docs/models.md`.

