Why this licence
----------------

The heads are a derivative of speechocean762, which is itself CC BY 4.0. CC BY
carries no ShareAlike condition, so a different licence was permitted here — but
matching the corpus keeps one rule over the whole chain instead of two that have
to be reconciled, and the attribution obligation is inherited regardless.

