What these weights are not
--------------------------

Not an examination score, and not affiliated with or endorsed by Pearson. The
10-90 range they report is a presentation choice calibrated against nothing.
`MODEL_CARD.md` states what they were measured on and where they fail; read it
before putting their output in front of a learner.
